   "no": 3,
   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>微震数据不需要「标注」，但要「配齐」：事件定位依赖速度模型与检波器布设，缺了它们误差球算不出来；验证更是硬约束——微震解释必须拿示踪剂、产剖这类<b>异源证据</b>对账，自己验证自己等于没验证。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>微地震事件</span><span class='cl-s'>时间、位置、震级，单段数千事件</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需人工标注，需附定位误差</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>施工曲线</span><span class='cl-s'>压力、排量、砂量，按段记录</span></span><span class='cl-n'>约束多解、核对簇数</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>示踪与产剖</span><span class='cl-s'>各段贡献</span></span><span class='cl-n'>异源验证真值，少量</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>速度模型与观测系统</span><span class='cl-s'>层速度、检波器位置</span></span><span class='cl-n'>决定定位误差，必须成套</span></div></div>"
